["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">緩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>松弛；缓和；放慢；放宽；减弱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆる.い・ゆる.やか・ゆる.む・ゆる.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">松的；不紧；宽松的；不严格的；平缓的；和缓的；缓慢的；微弱的；软的；不结实的；（用否定形「ゆるくない」）困难；不容易；费劲</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩和</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缓解；缓和；减轻；放宽（限制、紧张局势等）；松弛；软化</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">緩む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆるむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变松弛；松弛（如绳子）；变得不紧张；放松；放松警惕；（寒冷）缓和；减弱；（监管等）变得松懈；变软（如地面、表情）；（冰）部分融化；减慢；降低（如速度）；（市场价格）小幅下跌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">節</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>节（竹节、关节）；季节；时候（场合）；章节；曲调</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セツ・セチ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふし・-ぶし・のっと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">季節</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">季节；时令</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">節</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">时间；场合；章节；段落；乐段；诗节；（语法）从句；分句；季节；时令；时期；操守；节操；（植物茎的）节；（植物分类）组（属以下的分类等级）；节（航速单位，海里／小时）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">節約</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せつやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">节约；节省</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">射</