a\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">発揮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はっき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发挥；展现；表现；表露</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">指揮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">指挥；命令；监督；指挥（乐队、合唱团等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">充</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>填充；分配</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.てる・み.たす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拡充</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくじゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">扩充；扩大；增充</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">充実</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうじつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">充实；完整；完善；充实性；增强；改善；充实；升级；补充；充满</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">補充</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほじゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">补充；补充物；补充品；更换；补充供应</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貢</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>进贡；支持；资助</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みつ.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貢献</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贡献；效力；进贡；纳贡</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鹿</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a