=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">挑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>挑战；竞争；调情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いど.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挑む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いどむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">向……挑战；与……较量；争夺；应对（问题等）；尝试；争取（奖项、纪录等）；向（某人）求欢；对……施压要求性行为</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">挑戦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">挑战；对抗；尝试</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>引诱；邀请；诱惑；招致；劝诱</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さそ.う・いざな.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誘う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邀请；招待；召集；带领；诱惑；引诱；勾引；吸引；引起；激发；唤起</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勧誘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんゆう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邀请；劝诱；游说；诱导；劝说；鼓励</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誘導</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">引导；诱导；导向；引入；煽动；劝诱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">紛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>纠纷；混乱；混淆；丢失；排遣</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まぎ.れる・-まぎ.れ・まぎ.らす・まぎ.らわす・まぎ.らわしい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛失</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんしつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">丢失；遗失；失踪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛争</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纠纷；冲突；争端；骚乱；不和</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紛れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まぎれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">消失在；混入；隐没于；趁乱进行；利用混乱；极为相似；难以分辨；容易混淆；转移；忘却；被吸引；沉溺于；专注于</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">至</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>到达；达到；导致；极至；来临</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いた.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">至る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いたる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">到达；达到；获得；通往；导向；抵达；（～に至っては）至于；说到；甚至（举极端情况）；来临；到来；导致</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">至急</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">紧急；急迫；即刻；迅速；特急；紧急地；迅速地；立即；马上；毫不延迟；尽快</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乃至</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ないし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">从…到；…与…之间；或者；或</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>宗教；宗派；宗旨；起源；本质</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ・ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">むね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宗教</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宗教；宗教信仰；信仰；信念；教义；宗教活动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">慎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>谨慎；节制；谦逊；慎重</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つつし.む・つつ.ましい・つつし・つつし.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">慎重</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谨慎；小心谨慎；慎重；审慎</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">慎む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つつしむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">谨慎；小心；慎重；适度；节制；戒除；恭敬；虔诚；纯洁；清廉；贞洁</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">控</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>节制；克制；扣除；上诉；记录</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひか.える・ひか.え</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">控除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">扣除；减除（如税款等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">控室</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひかえしつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">等候室；前厅；接待室；化妆间</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">控える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">节制；克制；忍耐；自我约束；记下；抄录；记录（电话号码等）；做准备；等候；待机；即将来临；在即；近在咫尺；保持密切关系；充当幕后支持者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">智</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>智慧；智力；理性</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">握</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>握；捏；攥；抓；握（制作寿司）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">にぎ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">握手</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あくしゅ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">握手；和解；携手合作；协力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">握る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">握住；抓住；紧握；紧抓；掌握（答案）；握有（解决方案等）；是关键；是原因；夺取（权力）；掌握（缰绳）；支配；控制；捏制（握り寿司、饭团等）；用手塑形；按压成形；捏成</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">把握</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はあく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">掌握；把握</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>空中；空间；天空；时间；记忆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宇宙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宇宙；宇宙空间；太空</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宙返り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうがえり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">翻跟斗；空翻</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">俊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>卓越；聪慧；杰出</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">銭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>钱；硬币；货币；分（日元百分之一）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン・ゼン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぜに・すき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">金銭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">金钱；现金</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">小銭</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こぜに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">零钱；硬币；小额金钱；小笔钱款</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">渋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>涩味；犹豫；不情愿；腹泻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ・シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しぶ・しぶ.い・しぶ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">渋滞</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（交通）堵塞；塞车；交通拥堵；延误；停滞；滞缓</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">渋い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぶい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">涩；苦涩；涩口；粗涩；酸；朴素；淡雅；素雅；沉静；低调；有品味；愁眉苦脸；不悦；阴沉；闷闷不乐；吝啬；小气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">銃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>枪；火器</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">銃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">枪；枪支；小型武器</span></li></ul></div></li>"]